## Key facts
- Service: end-to-end apparel manufacturing and quality assurance for local (Egypt) and regional (Saudi Arabia, GCC, Libya) clients, managed by one accountable team.
- Network: 50+ specialized production partners in Egypt.
- Capacity: up to 50,000 pieces per month.
- Minimum order: 100 pieces per color (confirmed per project).
- Sampling: initial sample about 5 working days; pre-production sample about 3 working days.
- Bulk production: about 4 weeks standard, about 5 weeks in peak season.
- Quality: four quality gates (sample, first piece, inline at 10–20% of production, final). Final AQL inspection: zero critical defects, AQL 2.5 major, AQL 4.0 minor.
- Fabrics: knitted, woven and denim; sourced in Egypt, from trusted local suppliers, or selected suppliers in China.
